{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2994","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2994","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2994\",\"parent_revision\":\"f507ec72c781f01cb8c62ed3b7d67d05855df5aea3cfc052a79e4ceaef412693\",\"root_revision\":\"f507ec72c781f01cb8c62ed3b7d67d05855df5aea3cfc052a79e4ceaef412693\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Chore\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-19\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\n`plugins/holistic-linting/skills/holistic-linting/scripts/lint_orchestrator.py` has zero references anywhere in `plugins/`, `.github/`, or any `.md`/`.json`/`.yml` file repo-wide:\\n\\n```\\ngrep -rln \\\"lint_orchestrator\\\" plugins/ .github/\\n\u2192 plugins/holistic-linting/skills/holistic-linting/scripts/lint_orchestrator.py   (itself only)\\n```\\n\\nThis is the same class of dead code as `work-backlog-item/scripts/parser/parse.mjs`, which sat unreferenced until manual archaeology found and removed it in PR #2981. No lint or test currently checks whether a file under a skill's `scripts/` directory is referenced by that skill (or by any doc, test, or config in the repo).\\n\\nA naive version of this check (\\\"flag any script under `scripts/` not mentioned in its own `SKILL.md`\\\") was tried against the current repo during review and produced 24 flagged files out of 52 total scripts (46%) \u2014 mostly false positives such as `__init__.py`, `conftest.py`, and files that are genuinely referenced but only from a `README.md`, a test file, or another script's import rather than the `SKILL.md` itself. A rule that fires on nearly half the corpus on day one would get disabled rather than trusted.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the project infrastructure**, I want to **orphaned script lint_orchestrator.py is unreferenced repo-wide, and no dead-script detection exists** so that **the project infrastructure stays healthy**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Workflow-quality review, 2026-08-18/19, re-verified live 2026-08-19\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-19\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"b46e8f75aa06ca8a4a71b496fd8a48de7a7d815dacae4b79a0b78de4ca0630a9\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPgvn9Q\"}"}